        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-mwa5muwazo597oeipo",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "This nine-day itinerary takes you through several distinct regions of Colombia. Begin in Bogotá and its historic center, then visit Lake Guatavita and the Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá. Next, explore the Coffee Region, including the Cocora Valley, Salento and Hacienda Venecia coffee farm. The trip ends in Cartagena on the Caribbean coast."
